      "content": "interesting. so it's basically a trade-off between people who can contribute to the economy and people who are... more of a burden on the system? i guess you're saying the \"improvement\" happens because the community becomes more stable and productive. do these shifts usually happen along specific racial lines too, or is it just about class?",
